## Instructions
Review the diff for performance issues. You have the full file for context. Focus on:
- Unnecessary allocations or copies
- O(n²) or worse algorithms where linear solutions exist
- Missing caching or memoization opportunities
- N+1 query patterns (database or API)
- Blocking operations in async contexts
- Memory leaks or resource leaks
- Inefficient data structures
- Unnecessary network calls or I/O

Only flag issues that would have **meaningful impact** — don't flag micro-optimizations.

